# Nine-slice frame, 4px border: an earth surround over slate.
#
# The outer band is path-*, the same browns as the road, and the inside is
# keep-*. This palette has no timber ramp of its own — the game only ever
# needed grass, road, masonry and threat — and inventing one for a menu would
# have added two colours nothing else could use.
name towerdefense-ui-frame
size 16 16
key o outline
key W path-2
key w path-0-shadow
key k keep-1
key K keep-0-shadow
pixels
oooooooooooooooo
oWWWWWWWWWWWWWWo
oWwwwwwwwwwwwwWo
oWwkkkkkkkkkkwWo
*8 oWwkKKKKKKKKkwWo
oWwkkkkkkkkkkwWo
oWwwwwwwwwwwwwWo
owwwwwwwwwwwwwwo
oooooooooooooooo
